!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!
! Absorption cross-section HOCl: HOCl + hv --> OH + Cl
! source : JPL-2006 (no difference with crs-2004)
! http://www.atmosphere.mpg.de/enid/2295
! -> Catalogue -> "Hypohalides" -> "HOCl" -> "JPL-2006"
! Rem1: Quantum yield assumed to be unity (see note F.14, p.4-107 (JPL-2006))
!       whereas JPL-2006 also considers another branch (HCL + O(3P)).
! Rem2: Temperature indep. Let us point out that JPL-2006 does not provide
!       any information on the temperature dependence. I thus assumed that temperature
!       has no influence.
